<title>USA: Grant ends seismic operations for winter.</title>
<headline>Grant ends seismic operations for winter.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zydeco Energy Inc said Tuesday its seismic contractor for the West Cameron Transition Zone Project, Grant Geophysical Inc, is suspending data acquisition operations for the winter because of weather conditions.</p>
</text>
